 "description": "Schools serving a similar student population to a given school \u2014 same level, comparable free/reduced-lunch share and enrollment size \u2014 with the subject's standing among them. This is the fair comparison: a raw ranking largely reflects who enrolls, so a school's position against demographic peers says far more about the school itself than its statewide rank does. Public schools only.",
